# Generate Cloudflare Workers API Types

Use this skill when you need to generate types (`worker-configuration.d.ts`) for the Cloudflare Workers API.

## Instructions

1. Run `bun run cf-typegen`
2. Confirm the types are generated in the root directory `worker-configuration.d.ts`
